{"id":"workbook-014","book":"workbook","page":14,"title":"j, q, x kết hợp với ü","blocks":[{"id":"workbook-014-edited-0","title":"j, q, x kết hợp với ü","kind":"phonetics","items":[{"id":"workbook-014-edited-0-item-0","text":"声母“j、q、x”和韵母“ü”相拼时，“ü”上边的两点儿省略，写作“u”。","zh":"声母“j、q、x”和韵母“ü”相拼时，“ü”上边的两点儿省略，写作“u”。","pinyin":"shēng mǔ“ · hé yùn mǔ“ · xiāng pīn shí，“ · shàng biān de liǎng diǎn ér shěng lüè， xiě zuò“","vi":"Sau j, q, x, bỏ hai chấm của ü khi viết; chữ u ở đây vẫn đọc là ü.","translation":"edited","confidence":1,"reviewed":true,"role":"explanation"}]},{"id":"workbook-014-edited-1","title":"Đọc âm tiết","kind":"phonetics","items":[],"table":{"columns":["Thanh 1","Thanh 2","Thanh 3","Thanh 4"],"rows":[["jū","jú","jǔ","jù"],["qū","qú","qǔ","qù"],["xū","xú","xǔ","xù"]],"readings":[["","","",""],["","","",""],["","","",""]]}},{"id":"workbook-014-edited-2","title":"iou khi đứng riêng","kind":"phonetics","items":[{"id":"workbook-014-edited-2-item-0","text":"韵母“iou”单独成音节时，写作“you”。","zh":"韵母“iou”单独成音节时，写作“you”。","pinyin":"yùn mǔ“ · dān dú chéng yīn jié shí， xiě zuò“","vi":"Khi iou đứng riêng thành âm tiết, viết là you.","translation":"edited","confidence":1,"reviewed":true,"role":"example"}]},{"id":"workbook-014-edited-3","title":"Đọc theo thanh","kind":"phonetics","items":[],"table":{"columns":["Thanh 1","Thanh 2","Thanh 3","Thanh 4"],"rows":[["yōu","yóu","yǒu","yòu"]],"readings":[["","","",""]]}},{"id":"workbook-014-edited-4","title":"Đọc to từng từ","kind":"vocabulary","items":[{"id":"workbook-014-edited-4-item-0","text":"游泳","zh":"游泳","pinyin":"yóu yǒng","vi":"Bơi lội","translation":"edited","confidence":1,"reviewed":true,"role":"word"},{"id":"workbook-014-edited-4-item-1","text":"旅游","zh":"旅游","pinyin":"lǚyóu","vi":"Du lịch","translation":"edited","confidence":1,"reviewed":true,"role":"word"},{"id":"workbook-014-edited-4-item-2","text":"朋友","zh":"朋友","pinyin":"péngyou","vi":"Bạn bè","translation":"edited","confidence":1,"reviewed":true,"role":"word"}]},{"id":"workbook-014-edited-5","title":"iou sau thanh mẫu","kind":"phonetics","items":[{"id":"workbook-014-edited-5-item-0","text":"韵母“iou”和声母“m、d、n、l、j、q、x”相拼时，写作“iu”。例如：“miu、diu、niu、liu、jiu、qiu、xiu”。“iu”的声调要标在“u”上。","zh":"韵母“iou”和声母“m、d、n、l、j、q、x”相拼时，写作“iu”。例如：“miu、diu、niu、liu、jiu、qiu、xiu”。“iu”的声调要标在“u”上。","pinyin":"yùn mǔ“ · hé shēng mǔ“ · xiāng pīn shí， xiě zuò“ · lì rú：“ · de shēng diào yào biāo zài“ · shàng。","vi":"iou sau m, d, n, l, j, q, x viết thành iu; dấu thanh đặt trên u. Ví dụ: miu, diu, niu, liu, jiu, qiu, xiu.","translation":"edited","confidence":1,"reviewed":true,"role":"explanation"}]},{"id":"workbook-014-edited-6","title":"Đọc các âm với iu","kind":"phonetics","items":[],"table":{"columns":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7","8"],"rows":[["miù","diū","niú","liǔ","jiù","qiū","qiú","xiū"]],"readings":[["","","","","","","",""]]}},{"id":"workbook-014-edited-7","title":"Đọc to từng từ","kind":"vocabulary","items":[{"id":"workbook-014-edited-7-item-0","text":"九","zh":"九","pinyin":"jiǔ","vi":"Chín","translation":"edited","confidence":1,"reviewed":true,"role":"word"},{"id":"workbook-014-edited-7-item-1","text":"朋友","zh":"朋友","pinyin":"péngyou","vi":"Bạn bè","translation":"edited","confidence":1,"reviewed":true,"role":"word"},{"id":"workbook-014-edited-7-item-2","text":"牛奶","zh":"牛奶","pinyin":"niú nǎi","vi":"Sữa bò.","translation":"edited","confidence":1,"reviewed":true,"role":"word"},{"id":"workbook-014-edited-7-item-3","text":"休息","zh":"休息","pinyin":"xiū xi","vi":"Nghỉ ngơi","translation":"edited","confidence":1,"reviewed":true,"role":"word"}]}],"audioTracks":[]}